'''Glowy''' is an [[Uncommon Weapons|uncommon]] knife that was originally obtainable by unboxing it from the [[2023 Halloween Box|Halloween Box]] during the [[Halloween Event 2023]]. It is now only obtainable through [[trading]] as the event has since ended. 

== Appearance==
Its blade is black with three glowy pumpkins, one being pink, another being blue, and the last being yellow. Each pumpkin emits a lustrous backlight of their respective colors. The guard is golden, and the handle is solid black.

== Trivia ==

* It has a [[Glowy (Effect)|matching effect]] under the same name.

